OL,3,APolls open in US midterm elections that
OL,4,Awill shape rest of Trump's presidency
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's polling day in the US midterm
OL,7,Felections - millions of Americans are
OL,8,Fvoting to decide who will control
OL,9,FCongress for the final two years of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency
OL,12,FWhat's up for election? All 435 seats
OL,13,Fin the House; 35 of the 100 seats in
OL,14,Fthe Senate; and some state-level
OL,15,Fpoliticians, including governors. See
OL,16,Four basic explainer here
OL,18,FTrump's Republican Party controls the
OL,19,Ftwo chambers of Congress - Democrats
OL,20,Fare hoping to flip enough seats to win
OL,21,Fa majority in both
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
