OL,3,APolls open in US midterm elections that
OL,4,Awill shape rest of Trump's presidency
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf they control Congress, Democrats
OL,7,Fwould be better placed to block Trump's
OL,8,Fplans, and could also launch
OL,9,Finvestigations into the president and
OL,10,Fhis team. As Anthony Zurcher explains,
OL,11,Fthis could even include an attempt to
OL,12,Fimpeach Trump
OL,14,FThe first polling stations opened in
OL,15,FVermont at 05:00 ET (10:00 GMT) and
OL,16,Facross the east coast an hour later.
OL,17,FResults will start coming in this
OL,18,Fevening in the US - our quick timetable
OL,19,Fis here
